
  <main id="main">

    <section class="page-head">
      <div class="container">
        <span class="eyebrow">Pricing &amp; how we work</span>
        <h1>Low entry cost. No hourly rates.</h1>
        <p class="lead">A "from" price to start, then a fixed quote for your scope before we build. You see an estimate before you pay.</p>
        <div class="btn-row">
          <a href="start" class="btn btn--primary">Get an estimate</a>
          <a href="#care" class="btn btn--ghost">Hosting &amp; Care</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- PRICE LIST -->
    <section class="section section--tint" id="builds" aria-labelledby="pricesTitle">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="price-head reveal">
          <div>
            <h2 id="pricesTitle">Public pricing</h2>
            <p class="muted">Prices in ZAR. "From" prices vary with complexity; third-party costs like domains and AI usage are quoted separately.</p>
          </div>
          <p class="callout"><strong>Nothing to pay until you accept a fixed quote.</strong> Then a R500 deposit gets the build going and comes off your project price; the balance is due on completion.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="price-cols reveal">
          <div class="price-group">
            <h3>Websites</h3>
            <ul class="price-list price-list--compact">
              <li><a href="services#websites">Quick website<small>1 page, live in about a day</small></a><span class="price"><small>from</small>R1,000</span></li>
              <li><a href="services#websites">Business website<small>Up to 4–5 pages, custom layout</small></a><span class="price"><small>from</small>R2,000</span></li>
              <li><a href="services#websites">Custom website<small>Booking, online shop, portals</small></a><span class="price"><small>from</small>R4,500</span></li>
              <li><a href="services#websites">Changes to a site<small>Text, hours, images, small content</small></a><span class="price"><small>from</small>R250</span></li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="price-group">
            <h3>Software &amp; automation</h3>
            <ul class="price-list price-list--compact">
              <li><a href="start">Quick build<small>Forms, calculators, small tools</small></a><span class="price"><small>from</small>R1,000</span></li>
              <li><a href="services#dashboards">Dashboard<small>Built on your real business data</small></a><span class="price"><small>from</small>R2,000</span></li>
              <li><a href="services#automation">Automation<small>Replace a repetitive manual task</small></a><span class="price"><small>from</small>R2,000</span></li>
              <li><a href="services#ai">AI integration<small>Plus usage, billed separately</small></a><span class="price"><small>from</small>R3,500</span></li>
              <li><a href="services#software">Custom software<small>Larger apps quoted individually</small></a><span class="price"><small>from</small>R4,500</span></li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="small muted price-foot">Larger projects (typically R7,500, R15,000 or R30,000 and up) use a 30–50% deposit split across milestones and are quoted individually. <a class="inline-link" href="terms">Deposit terms</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- FIRST YEAR EXAMPLE -->
    <section class="section section--tint" aria-labelledby="fyTitle">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section__head section__head--center reveal">
          <span class="eyebrow">A worked example</span>
          <h2 id="fyTitle">What a first year actually looks like.</h2>
          <p>For a R1,000 one-page website with the first year of Care.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="table-wrap reveal" style="max-width:640px;margin-inline:auto">
          <table class="spec">
            <tbody>
              <tr><td>One-page website</td><td class="price" style="text-align:right">R1,000</td></tr>
              <tr><td>Care plan, first year</td><td class="price" style="text-align:right">R900</td></tr>
              <tr><td><strong>Total, first year</strong></td><td class="price" style="text-align:right"><strong>R1,900</strong></td></tr>
              <tr><td>Deposit, when you accept the quote</td><td class="price" style="text-align:right">R500</td></tr>
              <tr><td>Balance on completion</td><td class="price" style="text-align:right">R1,400</td></tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
        <p class="center small muted section__foot reveal">Domain registration is charged separately where applicable. Care is R90 a month or R900 a year after the first year (Hosting from R40 a month); development is one-off.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- HOSTING & CARE -->
    <section class="section" id="care" aria-labelledby="careTitle">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section__head section__head--center reveal">
          <span class="eyebrow">Hosting &amp; Care</span>
          <h2 id="careTitle">Kept online, from R40 a month.</h2>
          <p>A website is only online while it's hosted, so hosting is a running cost, not optional — separate from the one-off build. Ongoing sites take a plan (below), paid monthly or yearly; event or once-off sites are hosted just for the period you need. You own your domain and can host elsewhere if you prefer.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="grid plans">
          <div class="card plan reveal">
            <h3>Hosting</h3>
            <div class="plan__price">R40<small>/month</small></div>
            <p class="plan__yearly">or <strong>R400 a year</strong> (2 months free)</p>
            <p>Online, secure and backed up.</p>
            <ul><li>Website hosting</li><li>SSL certificate (the padlock)</li><li>Domain management</li><li>Backups</li><li>Uptime monitoring, every 10 minutes</li><li>Hosting-related support</li></ul>
            <p class="small muted" style="margin-top:0.6rem">Does not include changes to the site.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card plan plan--featured reveal">
            <span class="plan__flag">Recommended</span>
            <h3>Care</h3>
            <div class="plan__price">R90<small>/month</small></div>
            <p class="plan__yearly">or <strong>R900 a year</strong> (2 months free)</p>
            <p>Everything in Hosting, and we look after it for you.</p>
            <ul><li>Everything in Hosting</li><li>Small changes done for you: prices, photos, hours, contact details (about 30 min a quarter)</li><li>Your Google Business Profile kept up to date</li><li>A link your customers tap to leave you a Google review</li><li>A short monthly report: was your site up, and how fast it was</li></ul>
          </div>
          <div class="card plan reveal">
            <h3>Business Care</h3>
            <div class="plan__price">R240<small>/month</small></div>
            <p class="plan__yearly">or <strong>R2,400 a year</strong> (2 months free)</p>
            <p>For businesses that change often and want us on call.</p>
            <ul><li>Everything in Care</li><li>Priority support: same-day replies on weekdays</li><li>About 2 hours of changes a quarter</li><li>Performance and security checks</li></ul>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="offer-note" data-offer-note hidden></div>
        <ul class="plan-notes reveal">
          <li><strong>Pay monthly or yearly.</strong> Monthly: we email you a card payment link each month, or set up a bank stop order. Yearly: one payment and you get 2 months free.</li>
          <li><strong>New website?</strong> Your quote includes the first year of Care (R900), so you start fully looked after. After that, choose monthly or yearly, or switch to Hosting.</li>
          <li><strong>R100 off, every year:</strong> keep a small "Website by Re-Charge" link in your site's footer and your plan is R100 a year cheaper (R10 a month).</li>
          <li><strong>Refer a business:</strong> when a business you send us goes live, your next year of Care is free.</li>
          <li><strong>Already with us?</strong> You keep your current price until you choose to change plans.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- HOW WE WORK -->
    <section class="section section--tint" id="how-we-work" aria-labelledby="rulesTitle">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section__head reveal">
          <span class="eyebrow">How we work</span>
          <h2 id="rulesTitle">The rules that keep projects fast and fair.</h2>
          <p>These apply to every project. They protect your budget as much as our time — and they're why we can keep prices this low.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="rules reveal">
          <div class="rule"><h3>Fixed scope</h3><p>Every project has a defined scope before work starts, so both sides know what "done" means.</p></div>
          <div class="rule"><h3>Fixed price</h3><p>You get a fixed price for that scope. If the scope holds, the price holds.</p></div>
          <div class="rule"><h3>Quote, then deposit</h3><p>You accept a fixed quote online and pay the deposit before development begins — never before you've seen the price.</p></div>
          <div class="rule"><h3>You own it</h3><p>Your code, designs, data and domain are yours — move them if you ever leave.</p></div>
        </div>
        <p class="small muted section__foot reveal">Full terms — including refunds, revisions, delays, ownership and hosting — are on the <a class="inline-link" href="terms">Terms &amp; Deposit</a> page.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- FAQ -->
    <section class="section" id="faq" aria-labelledby="pricingFaqTitle">
      <div class="container container--narrow">
        <div class="section__head section__head--center reveal">
          <span class="eyebrow">Pricing questions</span>
          <h2 id="pricingFaqTitle">Common questions about cost.</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="faq reveal">
          <details class="faq__item"><summary>Why "from" prices instead of a fixed list?</summary><p>Because a one-page site and a booking site with payments are both "websites", but they aren't the same work. Starting prices tell you roughly where a project lands; the estimate in the Project Builder gets closer, and the final quote is exact.</p></details>
          <details class="faq__item"><summary>Is the estimate the final price?</summary><p>No. The estimate is indicative. We review your project, confirm the scope, and send a fixed quote before any development.</p></details>
          <details class="faq__item"><summary>When do I pay the R500 deposit?</summary><p>Only after you've seen and accepted your fixed quote. We send the quote online; if you're happy, you accept it and pay the R500 deposit by card (Yoco). It comes off your total, and the balance is due on completion. Asking for a quote is free.</p></details>
          <details class="faq__item"><summary>What does a typical first project cost?</summary><p>Most first projects are a quick build or one-page site (from R1,000). They're quick to deliver and a low-risk way to see how we work before anything bigger. Minor changes to an existing site start from R250.</p></details>
          <details class="faq__item"><summary>Can I start small and add to it later?</summary><p>Yes — that's the idea. A R1,000 website is an entry point, not the end product. Many clients add a dashboard, automation or a custom tool later, each quoted as its own small project.</p></details>
          <details class="faq__item"><summary>Is hosting required?</summary><p>Some hosting is needed to keep a site online — but not necessarily ours. Ongoing sites take an annual plan; event or once-off sites only need short-term hosting. You can also host elsewhere or provide your own; you always own your domain.</p></details>
          <details class="faq__item"><summary>What about AI running costs?</summary><p>Third-party AI/API usage is billed separately, based on actual usage, and explained before we build. We never bundle unlimited AI usage into a fixed price.</p></details>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="cta" aria-labelledby="pricingCtaTitle">
      <div class="container cta__inner reveal">
        <span class="cta__services">Estimate first · Fixed quote before we build</span>
        <h2 id="pricingCtaTitle">See what your project would cost.</h2>
        <p>Describe it in the Project Builder and get an indicative estimate straight away. We send a fixed quote — you pay the R500 deposit only once you accept it.</p>
        <div class="btn-row btn-row--center">
          <a href="start" class="btn btn--light btn--large">Start a Project</a>
          <button type="button" class="btn btn--free btn--large" data-mockup-open>Get a mockup <span class="btn__tag">Free</span></button>
        </div>
        <p class="small muted" style="margin-top:0.2rem">Not ready to commit? The mockup costs nothing — no deposit, no obligation.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

  </main>

